    "verdict_notes": "The reader linked defense-condition rows to V4 and labelled them limits_scope. That is wrong: they measure the study's own method. The original-model attack rates lack a no-attack control and use decoders of mixed safety training, so they cannot test V4. Judging is by gpt-4-turbo with no uncertainty reported."
